#: org.gtk.accerciser.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "The GNOME Project"
msgstr "Pwojè GNOME"

#: org.gtk.accerciser.metainfo.xml.in:13
msgid "Accessibility explorer for the GNOME desktop"
msgstr "Eksploratè aksesibilite pou biwo GNOME lan"

#: org.gtk.accerciser.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid ""
"Accerciser is an interactive Python accessibility explorer for the GNOME desktop. "
"It uses AT-SPI to inspect and control widgets, allowing you to check if an "
"application is providing correct information to assistive technologies and "
"automated test frameworks."
msgstr ""
"Accerciser se yon eksploratè aksesibilite Python entèraktif pou biwo GNOME lan. Li "
"itilize AT-SPI pou enspekte ak kontwole widjèt yo, sa ki pèmèt ou verifye si yon "
"aplikasyon ap bay bon enfòmasyon ak teknoloji asistans yo epi kad tès otomatik yo."

#: org.gtk.accerciser.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid ""
"Accerciser has a simple plugin framework which you can use to create custom views "
"of accessibility information."
msgstr ""
"Accerciser gen yon estrikti modil ekstensyon senp ou ka itilize pou kreye vi "
"pèsonalize pou enfòmasyon aksesibilite."

